ine-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E59A30"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5D290">In recognition of&nbsp;<strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5D4D0"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">XXX</span>'s</strong>&nbsp;partnership with Qantas, we would like to invite your business to&nbsp;<strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5D860">join the Qantas Business Rewards Program</strong>. Below you will find a link that will enable you to join the program, with no join fee.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5DBF0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5DD00"></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5E1A0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5E400" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; width: 600px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 40px;"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center" class="w100perc" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5E660" style="margin: 0px auto;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5E8C0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5EB20"><td width="6" align="right" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5ED80" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 0px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/join.html?code=QBRSUPPLYNATION" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5EFE0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543098/qa_primary_cta_l.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5F240" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></font></a></td><td height="40" bgcolor="#E40000" align="center" valign="middle" class="w100perc applelinkwhite" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5F6E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 16px; height: 40px; width: 100px; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0px 10px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/join.html?code=QBRSUPPLYNATION" target="_blank" alt="" style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Join now</font></a></td><td width="6" align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5F940" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 0px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/join.html?code=QBRSUPPLYNATION" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E60170" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543099/qa_primary_cta_r.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E602A0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E60D30"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E60F90" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E611F0">As a valued Qantas partner, once you have joined the Program you will automatically be&nbsp;<strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E61430">progressed to level 3</strong>. This upgrade to level 3 will enable your business to access the full range of benefits available in the Program, unlocking more rewards, bigger savings, and greater value.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E617C0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E61A00">As part of joining the Qantas Business Rewards Program, we would also like to invite you to&nbsp;<strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E61C40">schedule a call</strong>&nbsp;with one of our team members who will provide an overview of the Program, the benefits available to you as a Level 3 member and tips on how to get the most out of your membership. If you are interested in this, please reply with confirmation of your availability for a call and one of our team will be in contact with you.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E61FD0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E62210">To find out more about Qantas Business Rewards and to see your benefits as a Level 3 member, visit our&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E62450" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">website</a>.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E627E0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E628F0">If you have any questions or require assistance setting up your account, please call our Service Centre on 13 74 78 between 7am-7pm AEST, Monday to Friday.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E62B30"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E62C40"><em data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E62E80">Qantas Business Rewards</em></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013F734E0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013F73740" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013F73C00"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013F73E60" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013F75250"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013F754B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpaddi